The built-in themes are original pure-CSS gradients and contain no third-party
visual assets. CoSkin's understanding of Codex Desktop's DOM/token structure
was informed by the MIT-licensed projects HeiGeAi/heige-codex-skin-studio and
Fei-Away/Codex-Dream-Skin; this MIT license covers CoSkin's own source code
only. Users supply their own wallpaper images and are responsible for the
rights to any images or character art they import.
